# honest-limits: synthesized/test badge, NOT a real credential
# 'T5577' is a CHIP type, not a Flipper key protocol -- lfrfid files must
# name the protocol being emulated (lfrfid_protocols.c has no T5577
# entry). Re-keyed to EM4100 (5 bytes, 40-bit ID): T5577 chips are the
# common media for EM4100 clones, and EM4100 is fully validated by the
# workspace (on-wire frame rebuild + parity). DEADBEEF placeholder data.